BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f662d1a5-3b77-373c-9d3e-26f3e158c32e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
